    },
    "16": {
      "text": "<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,>Did Seadric just say that some villain is\nletting monsters into this dream world?<C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0003,000000FF>",
      "tokenized_text": "<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,>Did Seadric just say that some villain is\nletting monsters into this dream world?<C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0003,000000FF>",
      "original_text": "<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,>Did Seadric just say that some villain is\nletting monsters into this dream world?<C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0003,000000FF>",
      "original_tokenized_text": "<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,>Did Seadric just say that some villain is\nletting monsters into this dream world?<C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0003,000000FF>",
      "raw_full_hex": ""
    },
    "17": {
      "text": "<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,>Well, I haven't seen anyone, but...\nI have to say, it's a bit worrying...<C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0003,000000FF>",
      "tokenized_text": "<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,>Well, I haven't seen anyone, but...\nI have to say, it's a bit worrying...<C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0003,000000FF>",
      "original_text": "<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,>Well, I haven't seen anyone, but...\nI have to say, it's a bit worrying...<C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0003,000000FF>",
      "original_tokenized_text": "<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,>Well, I haven't seen anyone, but...\nI have to say, it's a bit worrying...<C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0003,000000FF>",
      "raw_full_hex": ""
    },
    "18": {
      "text": "<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,>Oh, but I don't want you to worry. I'm fine.\nYou can go check out the path ahead.<C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0004,>Just please, promise me you'll be careful.<C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0003,000000FF>",
      "tokenized_text": "<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,>Oh, but I don't want you to worry. I'm fine.\nYou can go check out the path ahead.<C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0004,>Just please, promise me you'll be careful.<C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0003,000000FF>",
      "original_text": "<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,>Oh, but I don't want you to worry. I'm fine.\nYou can go check out the path ahead.<C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0004,>Just please, promise me you'll be careful.<C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0003,000000FF>",
      "original_tokenized_text": "<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,>Oh, but I don't want you to worry. I'm fine.\nYou can go check out the path ahead.<C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0004,>Just please, promise me you'll be careful.<C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0003,000000FF>",
