    "20": {
      "text": "<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,>What is UP?!<C:0003,0000,0A00> Glad you made it, bros.\nBut...the dream world ends here.<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0004,>Unless...you got one more <C:0000,0003,2C65FFFF>Dream Egg<C:0000,0003,000000FF>?<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0003,0000,0A00>\nDidja? Didja snag that bad boy?<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0003,000000FF>",
      "tokenized_text": "<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,>What is UP?!<C:0003,0000,0A00> Glad you made it, bros.\nBut...the dream world ends here.<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0004,>Unless...you got one more <C:0000,0003,2C65FFFF>Dream Egg<C:0000,0003,000000FF>?<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0003,0000,0A00>\nDidja? Didja snag that bad boy?<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0003,000000FF>",
